<title>CANADA: Maple Leaf takes stake in China feed mill.</title>
<headline>Maple Leaf takes stake in China feed mill.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maple Leaf Foods International, a unit of Maple Leaf Food Inc, said on Wednesday it took its first stake in a venture in China by buying part of a newly built feed mill in a joint venture with Kam Wing Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details of the arrangement.</p>
<p>The food processing group's international trading unit will manage the mill, located in the province of Guangdong near Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The mill, developed by Mitchell Millwrights Ltd, began operating in May.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
